Apple is planning to release new 11-inch and 13-inch <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-pro/">iPad Pro</a> models in spring 2027, reports <em><a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-07-01/apple-readies-new-ipad-pro-redesigned-entry-macbook-pro-for-first-half-2027">Bloomberg</a></em>. No major design changes are expected, with Apple focusing on internal upgrades.<br/>
<br/>
